WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Confirm your store
The header identifies your store. Your account keeps records inside this
tenant; this label is not a switch to another business.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Prepare the catalog
Product, category, brand, attribute and stock shortcuts lead to the
store setup tasks. Complete variants, price and inventory before
promising availability.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Open the daily order desk
Use View all orders to inspect purchases. Order progress, payment
confirmation and shipment tracking are separate responsibilities.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Maintain the store and team
My store, Team and System organize store information, staff access and
configuration. Grant only the actions each employee needs.

